  "constraints": [
    "an advisory alias is an identity join only; related and upstream fields never imply supersession",
    "a superseding edge exists only when the withdrawn source details explicitly name the active duplicate target and the records share a package and external alias",
    "AFFECTED is assigned only by exact membership in affected.versions; FIXED_BOUNDARY only by exact equality with an ECOSYSTEM fixed event; all other package versions are UNKNOWN",
    "FIXED_COMMIT requires exact equality between a GIT fixed event hash and a GitHub FIX reference plus a frozen upstream patch receipt",
    "affected.versions is oracle metadata and excluded from language capacity so long version enumerations cannot act as padding",
    "global five-word-shingle Jaccard 0.90 near-duplicate collapse precedes capacity counting",
    "no advisory, field, patch, release metadata, padding, clone, split, or truncation may be repeated to fill a band",
    "capacity is preflight evidence only; all unchanged candidate, lineage, derived-view, truncation, shortcut, counterfactual, remove-one, and promotion gates remain mandatory"
